    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Mek Gunz",
    "summary": "In [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), after this unit has shot, provided every Mek Gunz model in it carries the same ranged weapons, pick an enemy unit those attacks hit. That unit gets the ability below named after that weapon, until your next turn:\n\n- **Bubblechukka**: the unit is **wobbled**, and the targets of its attacks get the [Benefit of Cover](vsdata:core-rule/benefit-of-cover) while it attacks\n- **Kustom Mega-kannon**: the unit is **zapped**, and gets -1 Ld while it is **zapped**\n- **Smasha Gun**: the unit is **smashed**, and gets -2\" M while it is **smashed**\n- **Traktor Kannon**: the unit is **grounded**, and is unable to [take to the skies](vsdata:core-rule/flying-models) while it is **grounded**\n\n**Designer's Note**: put 5 Grot Crew tokens beside each Mek Gun model, and take one away whenever that model loses a wound; the Mek Gun model itself stands for its last wound.",
